{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Violet Archive needs your help!\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1629830/extras/followers_left.gif?t=1741016900\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sightings of exotic plants and creatures near the town of Shimmerbrook have attracted a wave of new settlers. The Violet Archive was set up to record the development in the region, and is looking for researchers to aid its cause! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1629830/extras/Farm.gif?t=1741016900\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1629830/extras/Icon-research.png?t=1741016900\" />\u00a0A game about research and discovery</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Discover and record 90+\u00a0</strong>plants, creatures, and fish at various locations around Shimmerbrook, and contribute your findings to the Archive.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1629830/extras/Icon-crops.png?t=1741016900\" />\u00a0Forage for seeds, grow crops with different growth conditions</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Observe wild plants\u00a0</strong>and <strong>grow them as crops</strong>\u00a0based on their requirements!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1629830/extras/Icon-sproutkitten.png?t=1741016900\" />\u00a0Tame and raise 29 unique creatures!\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1629830/extras/Icon-sproutkitten_shimmer.png?t=1741016900\" /></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tame creatures as part of research</strong>! Observe wild creatures, learn their diet, and tame them with their favourite food!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Raise  creatures, meet their needs, and unlock their perks</strong>! Each creature has a unique ability: Chickens find you seeds, Sproutkittens grow seeds into sprouts instantly!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Collect Shimmers</strong>! These rare coloured variants give double the Produce!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1629830/extras/Sprout_Kitten.gif?t=1741016900\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1629830/extras/Chicken_move.gif?t=1741016900\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1629830/extras/Rock_Salamander.gif?t=1741016900\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1629830/extras/Chicken_move_shimmer.gif?t=1741016900\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1629830/extras/Shroomling.gif?t=1741016900\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1629830/extras/Icon-fishing.png?t=1741016900\" />\u00a0Fishing - some common fish, but also unique fish requiring research!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Find</strong> <strong>Fish Parts</strong>\u00a0and<strong>\u00a0use different bait</strong> to hook various fish!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1629830/extras/ss_fishing.jpg?t=1741016900\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1629830/extras/Icon-gems.png?t=1741016900\" />\u00a0Dive deep into the Mines!\u00a0</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mine ores and gems</strong>\u00a0in the Mines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Certain plants and creatures can be found only in the Mines!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1629830/extras/Icon-artifact.png?t=1741016900\" />Explore the puzzle caves to uncover the mystery behind Shimmerbrook</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Complete puzzles to obtain Artifacts</strong>! Each puzzle you solve brings you one step closer to learning the truth behind the proliferation of flora and fauna in Shimmerbrook.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1629830/extras/ss_puzzle.jpg?t=1741016900\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1629830/extras/Icon-cook.png?t=1741016900\" />\u00a0Cook, craft, build, and more!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cook meals</strong> to gain buffs!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Craft and automate</strong> with sprinklers, auto-feeders, and more!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1629830/extras/Icon-heart.png?t=1741016900\" />\u00a0Meet the townsfolk!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Befriend townsfolk</strong>! From a druid whose family has lived for generations in the mountains, to a featherfolk whose first job is in this new town - many characters await in Shimmerbrook!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Schedule Hangout Events</strong> with them to learn more about their stories!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Romance</strong> any of the 10 romanceables to unlock romantic dates and special dialogue!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1629830/extras/ss_eira_dialogue.jpg?t=1741016900\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1629830/extras/Steam_Description_NPCs_600px.png?t=1741016900\" /></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Publication","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1629830/407b197a8a1074cb84b122533131e179f910dc6a.jpg"},{"name":"Novice Researcher","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1629830/de98050ad33ea397fc30f4f5a1382db642a461db.jpg"},{"name":"Expert Researcher","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1629830/73b7d3bcd376f4f83d2fb42552353d5dda18efc8.jpg"},{"name":"Sharing Specimens","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1629830/bcfd2992e2d28f32d3596fa80de9fd40992d0114.jpg"},{"name":"Pocket Change","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1629830/75f04941f96593bc334d2b404213fe4751d55a7b.jpg"},{"name":"Hustling Researcher","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1629830/af7f0563963ec3bd9f02b24e837a0088fed2d254.jpg"},{"name":"Well-funded Researcher","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1629830/9536af4690b29bbf6b312cd18af75f2b10245ab8.jpg"},{"name":"Creature Keeper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1629830/b02b9fe914a005bfc5dc82271f3bd2b3f5c382e1.jpg"},{"name":"Creature Expert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/